<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN sets BEF 18 bln facility for Mobistar.</title>
<headline>ABN sets BEF 18 bln facility for Mobistar.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch bank ABN AMRO NV said on Tuesday it had acted as lead arranger and co-ordinator for an 18 billion Belgian franc syndicated project finance facility for Mobistar, operator of Belgium's second mobile phone network.</p>
<p>Banque Nationale de Paris was also a lead arranger of the facility.</p>
<p>Sumitomo Bank Ltd, Dresdner Bank AG and Kredietbank NV were co-arrangers.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
